<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Det's Xenotypes - Buzzers + Alpha Genes: the Buzzer xenotype also carries Alpha Genes' hiveling voice and insect blood.
		This folder only loads when Buzzers is active (see loadFolders.xml); the Alpha Genes part is a subfolder gated on it.
		Changes from the original: its relabel of AG_HivelingVoice to "insect voice" was dropped (Alpha Genes keeps its own
		name, matching the VRE Insector integration). The original's second block (Venators' farsighted gene added to the
		Buzzer while Buzzers' own compound-eyes gene was stripped to 0 metabolism and no stats) was dropped, together with the
		"bulbous eyes" rename in the core name-change file that described the stripped gene.
		The original folder had no packageId gate (TODO in the core loadFolders); it is now det.buzzers, taken from other mods'
		gates. Buzzers is not installed here, so DV_Buzzer could not be checked; both Alpha Genes genes exist.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs/XenotypeDef[defName="DV_Buzzer"]/genes</xpath>
		<value>
			<li>AG_HivelingVoice</li>
			<li>AG_InsectBlood</li>
		</value>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
